  "an5.77:0.3": "<p><i>This sutta and the three following it are apparently the “future danger” suttas that King Asoka advised monks, nuns, lay men, and lay women to listen to frequently and to ponder so that the True Dhamma will last a long time.</i></p><p>See also: <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn3.17'>SN 3:17</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn35.97'>SN 35:97</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn55.40'>SN 55:40</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an6.19'>AN 6:19—20</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an10.15'>AN 10:15</a></p>",
